# Configuration B of the load-discrimination experiment: identical to
# merlin_shape_buffer4mib.topo in every parameter except the shared
# buffer, 1 MiB instead of 4 MiB. At the wave-19 captured loads the
# two configurations are indistinguishable (solo-cell occupancy stays
# at the in-service packet scale, so every scored row of the
# calibration study is insensitive to this knob); the experiment's
# registered claim is that a load-bearing fabric separates them.
# Study instance for capability and sanity evidence; no claim about
# the Merlin fabric's real buffer sizing is made.
topology dragonfly
hosts_per_router 20
routers_per_group 1
global_links_per_router 0
groups 1
host_link_gbps 200
host_link_latency_ps 300000
switch_pipeline_ps 350000
rosetta_buffer_bytes 1048576
max_wire_packet_bytes 9038
routing_seed 383530136519245852
